    <p>Alongside that, I was selected for the government's Kampus Merdeka Independent Study Program (MSIB), where I led a small team, and I've stayed close to community organizing through UKM E-Sport. I also completed a 900-hour data analytics and AI-assisted development program at RevoU, which is where the tables below come from.</p>
    <p>Right now I'm looking at roles in data administration, sales operations, or marketing support — anywhere precision and follow-through actually matter.</p>
